== Rights and duties of partners [Sec. 11(1)] <11-1>

The mutual rights and duties of the partners of a firm may be determined by the Partnership deed. Such contract may be expressed or may be implied by a course of dealing.

Change in contract - only by consent(expressed or implied) of all partners.

=== Agreements in restraint of trade

#table( columns: (auto, auto, auto), inset: 10pt, align: (center, left, left), table.header( [ *Section* ],[ *When it applies* ],[ *Conditions* ],),



[11(2)],
[ while he is a partner],
[a partner shall not carry on any business other than that of the firm],

[36(2)],
[on ceasing to be a partner],
[he will not compete with the firm for a specified period or within specified local limits],

[54],
[ upon or anticipation of the dissolution of the firm ],
[ some or all partners will not compete with the firm for a specified period or within specified local limits ],

[55(3)],
[upon the sale of the goodwill of a firm ],
[ such partner(seller) will not compete with the firm for a specified period or within specified local limits.],
